    "image_with_text_8r7xar": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_E8iHpm": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Artful, Travel-Inspired Footwear for Real Life",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "subheading_wUGJ7p": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "INKED BY ARTISTS, MADE TO MOVE YOU ♥️"
          }
        },
        "text_YxUDrp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Inkkas is an independent footwear brand where every design begins as a hand-drawn work of art. Our collections are brought to life through thoughtful design and handcrafted production, blending art with adventure in every step. Each shoe is woven with stories from the Andes to the Sahara and built with soles designed for all-season exploration.</p><p>We invite you to step into one-of-a-kind, ultra-comfy shoes that let you express yourself, move freely, and feel connected to the world around you.</p><p>Inkkas is run by a small family team based in Takoma Park, Maryland. Our shoes are 100% handmade in Latin America using authentic textiles sourced globally. What began as a creative shoe idea in 2012 has grown into a worldwide community of artists and customers who value art, adventure, and conscious design. We remain proudly independent, building thoughtfully and staying closely connected. Thank you for being here.</p>",
            "description_size": "medium"
          }
        }
      },
