            "image": "shopify://shop_images/BLAKE-SLIP-ON-KL302333-MODELZOOM-ART-IMG_7673.jpg",
            "image_full_width": false,
            "retina": true,
            "title": "1. It All Starts with Art.",
            "text": "<p>Every pair of <em><strong>inkkas</strong></em> begins as a hand-<em><strong>inked</strong></em> work of art — created to spark joy, connection, and inspiration. Our collections draw from the colors, textures, and patterns of our planet to celebrate beauty everywhere. But that’s just where the journey begins.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_qLhgRr": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/5W1A8149.jpg",
            "image_full_width": false,
            "retina": true,
            "title": "2. Beauty Meets Function.",
            "text": "<p>Each sketch is carefully transformed into a handcrafted shoe: where artistry meets engineering. Using high-quality, responsible materials and time-honored techniques, we build comfort into every detail: cushioned insoles, supportive soles, and a fit that feels like it was made just for you.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_aK6FzF": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/making_of_the_joggers-ezgif.com-optiwebp.webp",
            "image_full_width": true,
            "retina": true,
            "title": "3. Made to be Loved.",
            "text": "<p>Then comes the best part — you! When you step into a pair of Inkkas, expect that unmistakable confidence that comes from walking in something one-of-a-kind. Shoes that feel good for the soul (and the sole), good for the planet, and worthy of your next adventure.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
