        "heading_wnxVGx": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Walking the Talk",
            "heading_size": "h3"
          }
        },
        "subheading_gBj8Hx": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "ONE SHOE ONE TREE™"
          }
        },
        "text_aPJiCC": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>For every purchase, we plant one tree through our <em><strong>OneShoeOneTree</strong></em>™ program with trees.org — supporting reforestation, biodiversity, and climate resilience. </p><p>In addition to tree planting, we:</p><ul><li>ensure fair and ethical practices across our supply chain</li><li>make our collections in small batches and allow pre-order to limit overproduction and waste</li><li>donate worn pairs to our partner Soles4Souls for refurbishment to those in need</li></ul><p>Thank you for walking with us — every step, every story, every adventure.</p>",
            "description_size": "small"
          }
        },
